  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development,  by virtue of its height, sitting, proximity to the shared boundaries and fenestration would give rise to an unneighbourly loss of privacy, sunlight and daylight, outlook, as perceived from neighbouring properties including Nos. 113A Bullsmoor Lane and  & No.2 Langdale Gardens contrary to Section 12 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies D3, D4, D5, D6, D8 of the London Plan (2021), CP4 and CP30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), DMD6, DMD7, DMD8, DMD10 and DMD37 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014) and the London Housing Supplementary Planning Guidance (2023)."
